|= Symbol |= Actor Type |
| (A) | Guest (External User) |
| (B) | Pelanggan (Customer) |
| (C) | Peternak (Farmer) |
| (D) | Staf (Staff) |
| (E) | Admin (Administrator) |
| (F) | External System |
endlegend

' ============================================
' NOTES
' ============================================

note bottom of UC01
Registrasi akun baru
dengan verifikasi email
end note

note bottom of UC09
Integrasi Midtrans Snap Token
untuk pembayaran aman
end note

note bottom of UC10
Booking untuk ternak hidup
(Cart Order = Daging Segar)
(Inquiry Order = Ternak Hidup)
end note

note bottom of UC62
Import bulk via Excel/CSV
Mendukung: Livestock, Fresh, Supply
end note

note bottom of UC68
Tipe Kampanye:
- Birthday, New Customer
- Loyalty, Weekend Sale
- Flash Sale, Free Shipping
- Cashback, Review Reward
end note

note bottom of UC47
Tipe Care Record:
- Feeding
- Vaccination
- Health Check
- Cleaning
end note

